# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 040E:00A1"
msgid "Gwillim"
msgstr "威廉"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 040E:00C3"
msgid "Herdsman "
msgstr "牧民"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 040E:0192"
msgid "I would not do that if I were you! "
msgstr "換作是我，可不會那麼做！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 040E:01C8"
msgid "Stop! Thief! "
msgstr "站住！小偷！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:05C7"
msgid "Good day. "
msgstr "日安。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:063A"
msgid "Ahh, what a fine bunch of torax! "
msgstr "啊，多棒的一群托拉克斯獸！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:06A6"
msgid "Shelby! Leave Pono alone! "
msgstr "雪比！別去惹波諾！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:073D"
msgid "Have you ever seen such fine torax? "
msgstr "你見過這麼好的托拉克斯獸嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:079D"
msgid "How I love my flock. "
msgstr "我真愛我的獸群。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:07DC"
msgid "I wonder how Cyrrus is doing? "
msgstr "不知道席勒斯過得怎麼樣？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:0861"
msgid "This life does get a bit boring from time to time. "
msgstr "這種生活有時還真有點無聊。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:089B"
msgid "I hope that Cyrrus is well. "
msgstr "希望席勒斯一切安好。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:090A"
msgid "I enjoy caring for my flock. "
msgstr "我喜歡照顧我的獸群。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:096C"
msgid "Yet, I would enjoy some company now and again. "
msgstr "不過，偶爾有人作伴也不錯。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:09C7"
msgid "I can see my house from here! "
msgstr "從這裡就看得到我家！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 10 (enterFastArea)
msgctxt "bark 040E:0A0C"
msgid "The torax certainly are playful today. "
msgstr "托拉克斯獸今天可真愛玩。"

